> ### Should I Build an Agent? (28 October 2026, 11:24:39 +0100)
>
> Before choosing the agent tier, check all four criteria: (28 October 2026, 11:24:39 +0100)
>
> - **Complexity** - Is the task multi-step and hard to fully specify in advance? (e.g., "turn this design doc into a PR" vs. "extract the title from this PDF") (28 October 2026, 11:24:39 +0100)
> - **Value** - Does the outcome justify higher cost and latency? (28 October 2026, 11:24:39 +0100)
> - **Viability** - Is Claude capable at this task type? (28 October 2026, 11:24:39 +0100)
