> ## Compaction (Quick Reference) (28 October 2026, 11:24:39 +0100)
>
> **Beta, Fable 5/5.1, Opus 5.5, Opus 5, Opus 4.8, Opus 4.7, Opus 4.6, Sonnet 5.5, Sonnet 5, Sonnet 4.6, and Claude Haiku 5.5.** For long-running conversations that may exceed the 1M context window, enable server-side compaction. The API automatically summarizes earlier context when it approaches the trigger threshold (default: 150K tokens). Requires beta header `compact-2026-01-12`. (28 October 2026, 11:24:39 +0100)
